e else: he is a robot.\",\"genres\":[\"Crime\",\"Action\",\"Sci-Fi\"],\"daysUntil\":null},{\"id\":440471,\"title\":\"Escape Plan 2: Hades\",\"poster\":\"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w780/A6tb8JNrie2qT8JC2tGqshayuck.jpg\",\"backdrop\":\"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/original/xIAaN3AQqaJiN5RJ0WsmBady8Hq.jpg\",\"rating\":5.1,\"year\":2018,\"type\":\"movie\",\"overview\":\"Ray Breslin manages an elite team of security specialists trained in the art of breaking people out of the world's most impenetrable prisons. When his most trusted operative, Shu Ren, is kidnapped and disappears inside the most elaborate prison ever built, Ray must track him down with the help of some of his former friends.\",\"genres\":[\"Action\",\"Thriller\",\"Crime\"],\"daysUntil\":null},{\"id\":302156,\"title\":\"Criminal\",\"poster\":\"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w780/hn6HmGTopbbxv4Myy2IwGWxViFP.jpg\",\"backdrop\":\"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/original/nZscubw1LcZ2ZRjPt92A0C2JcQy.jpg\",\"rating\":6.2,\"year\":2016,\"type\":\"movie\",\"overview\":\"CIA Agent Bill Pope is on a mission to track down a shadowy hacker named 'The Dutchman'. When he gets mysteriously killed, an experimental procedure transfers his memories into a dangerous ex-convict. When he wakes up Pope's memories, his mission is to eliminate The Dutchman before the hacker launches ICBMs and starts World War III.\",\"genres\":[\"Action\",\"Crime\",\"Sci-Fi\"],\"daysUntil\":null},{\"id\":605116,\"title\":\"Project Power\",\"poster\":\"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w780/TnOeov4w0sTtV2gqICqIxVi74V.jpg\",\"backdrop\":\"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/original/qVygtf2vU15L2yKS4Ke44U4oMdD.jpg\",\"rating\":6.4,\"year\":2020,\"type\":\"movie\",\"overview\":\"An ex-soldier, a teen and a cop collide in New Orleans as they hunt for the source behind a dangerous new pill that grants users temporary superpowers.\",\"genres\":[\"Action\",\"Crime\",\"Sci-Fi\"],\"daysUntil\":null},{\"id\":932420,\"title\":\"Code 8 Part II\",\"poster\":\"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w780/h89INyaoH16CdlT7q7BtKikIFRy.jpg\",\"backdrop\":\"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/original/ekRp1sEA8pnuzVHQkUESTgNSKdW.jpg\",\"rating\":6.4,\"year\":2024,\"type\":\"movie\",\"overview\":\"In a world where superpowered people are heavily policed by robots, an ex-con teams up with a drug lord he despises to protect a teen from a corrupt cop.\",\"genres\":[\"Sci-Fi\",\"Action\",\"Crime\"],\"daysUntil\":null},{\"id\":461130,\"title\":\"Code 8\",\"poster\":\"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w780/izGX7npHEopDQvngYcxMJEfcFbj.jpg\",\"backdrop\":\"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/original/gqbgCJUZyy4NEdk5m0qxaNOvAqq.jpg\",\"rating\":6.3,\"year\":2019,\"type\":\"movie\",\"overview\":\"In Lincoln City, some inhabitants have extraordinary abilities. Most live below the poverty line, under the close surveillance of a heavily militarized police force. Connor, a construction worker with powers, involves with a criminal gang to help his ailing mother. (Based on the short film “Code 8,” 2016.)\",\"genres\":[\"Sci-Fi\",\"Action\",\"Crime\"],\"daysUntil\":null},{\"id\":629176,\"title\":\"Samaritan\",\"poster\":\"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w780/zgH8Ej50n2cvJCMJrxd4twEwSqz.jpg\",\"backdrop\":\"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/original/hYZ4a0JvPETdfgJJ9ZzyFufq8KQ.jpg\",\"rating\":6.6,\"year\":2022,\"type\":\"movie\",\"overview\":\"Thirteen year old Sam Cleary suspects that his mysteriously reclusive neighbor Mr. Smith is actually the legendary vigilante Samaritan, who was reported dead 25 years ago. With crime on the rise and the city on the brink of chaos, Sam makes it his mission to coax his neighbor out of hiding to save the city from ruin.\",\"genres\":[\"Sci-Fi\",\"Crime\",\"Action\"],\"daysUntil\":null},{\"id\":31867,\"title\":\"Repo Men\",\"poster\":\"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w780/1ZA5kEKuA6HgbyzZXXlyU4piNI.jpg\",\"backdrop\":\"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/original/wQLcXBc0b4yNT542qxcZfb0KM40.jpg\",\"rating\":6.3,\"year\":2010,\"type\":\"movie\",\"overview\":\"In the future, medical technology has advanced to the point where people can buy artificial organs to extend their lives. But if they default on payments, an organization known as the Union sends agents to repossess the organs. Remy is one of the best agents in the business, but when he becomes the recipient of an artificial heart, he finds himself in the same dire straits as his many victims.\",\"genres\":[\"Action\",\"Sci-Fi\",\"Thriller\"],\"daysUntil\":null},{\"id\":13851,\"title\":\"Batman: Gotham Knight\",\"poster\":\"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w780/3i1o0sHBP0VUpuSVmkdCRKYoDBC.jpg\",\"backdrop\":\"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/original/sGVOhdD4nlzJX5PV8xArhLSJZC9.jpg\",\"rating\":6.7,\"year\":2008,\"type\":\"movie\",\"overview\":\"Six interlocking stories reveal Bruce Wayne's earliest adventures as Batman and the steps he took to become the grim avenger of Gotham City.\",\"genres\":[\"Action\",\"Crime\",\"Animation\"],\"daysUntil\":null},{\"id\":581997,\"title\":\"Batman vs Teenage Mutant Ninja Turtles\",\"poster\":\"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w780/yP3h0Pu8htyb9450mWJ9Vu1rU.jpg\",\"backdrop\":\"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/original/sA50fD5aLbYPRU0fMCHIZ88gc5g.jpg\",\"rating\":7.2,\"year\":2019,\"type\":\"movie\",\"overview\":\"Batman, Batgirl, and Robin forge an alliance with the Teenage Mutant Ninja Turtles to fight against the Turtles' sworn enemy, The Shredder, who has apparently teamed up with Ra's Al Ghul and The League of Assassins.\",\"genres\":[\"Animation\",\"Sci-Fi\",\"Adventure\"],\"daysUntil\":null},{\"id\":42194,\"title\":\"Tekken\",\"poster\":\"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w780/1xO2LirDZstkqZic1FwfK6GJIHH.jpg\",\"backdrop\":\"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/original/sHm4T1o2lMYJHfch7aNxaiJPjsO.jpg\",\"rating\":5.3,\"year\":2010,\"type\":\"movie\",\"overview\":\"In the year of 2039, after World Wars destroy much of the civilization as we know it, territories are no longer run by governments, but by corporations; the mightiest of which is the Mishima Zaibatsu. In order to placate the seething mass